# table_add_extra_ball via the 1MAX cheat: extra ball, text 3011, sound tabc21wave (loader sound index from a native run).
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
30 type 1MAX
70 expect extra_balls == 1
30-70 expect text info_text_box display id 3011
30-70 expect sound 27
80 quit
